{"title":"Career roadmap · NGO Officer","role":"NGO Officer","summary":"An NGO Officer works with nonprofit and civil-society organisations to plan, implement, monitor, document, and coordinate programmes addressing social, humanitarian, human-rights, peacebuilding, development, or community needs.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career alignment"},{"type":"p","text":"An NGO Officer works with nonprofit and civil-society organisations to plan, implement, monitor, document, and coordinate programmes addressing social, humanitarian, human-rights, peacebuilding, development, or community needs."},{"type":"p","text":"A BA in Peace & Conflict Studies / Human Rights provides a strong foundation in conflict analysis, human rights, international relations, peacebuilding, humanitarian issues, social justice, governance, and community development."},{"type":"p","text":"To become employable, the student should add programme management, monitoring & evaluation, field research, data analysis, proposal writing, safeguarding, fundraising, and stakeholder coordination."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Roles","Main Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"NGO Intern, Programme Assistant"},{"text":"Field and programme support"}],[{"text":"Early Career"},{"text":"NGO Officer, Programme Associate"},{"text":"Programme implementation"}],[{"text":"Developing"},{"text":"Project Officer, Programme Officer"},{"text":"Programme coordination"}],[{"text":"Mid Career"},{"text":"Senior Programme Officer, Project Manager"},{"text":"Programme delivery and teams"}],[{"text":"Advanced"},{"text":"Programme Manager, Regional Coordinator"},{"text":"Multi-location programmes"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Programme Director, Head of Programmes"},{"text":"Strategy and portfolio management"}],[{"text":"Specialist"},{"text":"Human Rights/